OL,3,GNEWSAMan who died after crash was
OL,4,A'beautiful person'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who died nearly a week after he
OL,7,Fwas injured in a crash involving two
OL,8,Fmotorbikes had the "biggest heart" and
OL,9,Fwas a "beautiful, amazing person", his
OL,10,Ffamily has said.
OL,12,FHenry Templeton, 21, from Reading, died
OL,13,Fon 2 October following a collision at
OL,14,Fabout 02:15 BST on 26 September in
OL,15,FVastern Road, Reading.
OL,17,FIn a tribute released by Thames Valley
OL,18,FPolice (TVP), his family said he
OL,19,Fbrought "chaos, laughter and love
OL,20,Fwherever he went".
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
